{"id":"775e79fda1f79171","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-canonicalforms.md","title":"Truth-table minterm DNF and maxterm CNF","display":"df-canonicalforms — Truth-table minterm DNF and maxterm CNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-canonicalforms","aliases":["27-df-canonicalforms"],"display":"df-canonicalforms — Truth-table minterm DNF and maxterm CNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-literal]]","[[27-df-term]]","[[27-df-clause]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.4 Theorem 1.4, equations (1.6)–(1.8), Definition 1.11","source_printed_pages":"16–17","source_pdf_pages":"40–41","verification_status":"source-construction-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-canonicalforms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-canonicalforms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonicalforms — Truth-table minterm DNF and maxterm CNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.4 Theorem 1.4, equations (1.6)–(1.8), Definition 1.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"16–17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"40–41"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-construction-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；文字、项、子句、真假点见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_a^+\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=1\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=0\\},\\qquad L_a^-\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=0\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_a^+\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=1\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=0\\},\\qquad L_a^-\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=0\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MintermDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{T_{L_a^+}\\mid a\\in T(f)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{C_{L_a^-}\\mid a\\in F(f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MintermDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{T_{L_a^+}\\mid a\\in T(f)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{C_{L_a^-}\\mid a\\in F(f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>minterm 仅在对应点 a 为 1；maxterm 仅在对应点 a 为 0。两者不同于以全部 prime 为元素的 Blake canonical form。重复和顺序已在集合表示中忽略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；文字、项、子句、真假点见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；文字、项、子句、真假点见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；文字、项、子句、真假点见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；文字、项、子句、真假点见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"L_a^+\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=1\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=0\\},\\qquad L_a^-\\coloneqq\\{x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=0\\}\\cup\\{\\bar x_i\\mid i\\in[n]\\land a_i=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MintermDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{T_{L_a^+}\\mid a\\in T(f)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{C_{L_a^-}\\mid a\\in F(f)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1532,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-canonicalforms|df-canonicalforms — Truth-table minterm DNF and maxterm CNF]]"},{"id":"8c0a6e3c38dda0eb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；规范形式见 [[27-df-canonicalforms]]，求值见 [[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{CLits}$ 见 [[27-df-clause]]。"}],"outgoing":["99c92f3457aacd12","e065076d6b51508e","74438714e304bba9","98e5c19fe4a2b9e2"]}